<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Archuleta &amp; Hinsdale Ctys, Colo..</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Archuleta &amp; Hinsdale Ctys, Colo..</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dain Bosworth Inc said it priced $12.020 million of Archuleta and Hinsdale Counties School District No. 50 (Pagosa Springs), Colo., general obligation bonds with a top yield of 5.60 percent in 2020.</p>
</text>
